# Research template — extra runtime knobs merged by `enclave init` (core keys are generated for you).
# NO inline comments after values.
# A web-research agent fetches open-web sources over read-only HTTP GET (the guard already allows GETs
# and blocks writes/deploys), so no cloud profile is needed. Leave this file minimal; add knobs only if
# a specific research target needs a read-only bridge. (For PRIVATE cloud/warehouse data use the
# `analyst` template instead — it ships GUARD_CLOUD_READONLY=1.)
